{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"t":"1718867188","x":0.77160493914987061,"y":0.046511627815782663,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.069958845774332645,"c":0.5},{"y":0.097383720794351092,"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.1008230390430009,"t":"READING PASSAGE 2","w":0.29012346903483077,"c":1},{"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 14-26, which are based on Reading","y":0.13221436957039645,"w":0.77160491943359377,"h":0.016041444524578563,"c":1,"x":0.10288066774952029},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.10082304603636369,"w":0.16049382527669273,"t":"Passage 2 below.","y":0.14811542989938142,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"w":0.016460905075073237,"t":"B","x":0.10082304530196955,"y":0.35319767419203929},{"w":0.11952081044514973,"c":1,"t":"Palm oil","x":0.43406675516188964,"h":0.019468554619203937,"y":0.18139944360187488},{"y":0.22084805635159399,"c":1,"w":0.72427983601888013,"t":"Palm oil is an edible oil derived from the fruit of the African oil palm tree, and is currently","h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.14197530821013857},{"y":0.23691860451567004,"t":"the most consumed vegetable oil in the world. It's almost certainly in the soap we wash with","x":0.14609054178312353,"w":0.73251027425130222,"h":0.014553715960858749,"c":1},{"y":0.25436046498315779,"w":0.70370371500651041,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.14609052923862076,"t":"in the morning, the sandwich we have for lunch, and the biscuits we snack on during the"},{"c":1,"x":0.14403293269376519,"t":"day. Why is palm oil so attractive for manufacturers? Primarily because its unique properties","w":0.7386831156412762,"y":0.2703180210937759,"h":0.016019187630697096},{"y":0.28769140140427263,"c":1,"x":0.14609054488638559,"t":"- such as remaining solid at room temperature - make it an ideal ingredient for long-term","w":0.71399175008138005,"h":0.013250883392226243},{"t":"preservation, allowing many packaged foods on supermarket shelves to have 'best before'","x":0.14603152439384567,"y":0.30230215317366715,"w":0.7182291666666667,"h":0.016949509844201405,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.35185185750325521,"t":"dates of months, even years, into the future.","x":0.14403291886751929,"y":0.32122093008347985,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"x":0.14403291075259356,"t":"Many farmers have seized the opportunity to maximise the planting of oil palm trees.","y":0.35306242662819265,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"w":0.68312759399414058},{"c":1,"y":0.37063953473765787,"t":"Between 1990 and 2012, the global land area devoted to growing oil palm trees grew from","w":0.72222223917643225,"x":0.1440329132270286,"h":0.015991796172268868},{"y":0.38662790716552653,"t":"6 to 17 million hectares, now accounting for around ten percent of total cropland in the","h":0.014534882858869391,"w":0.69341562906901044,"c":1,"x":0.14609053776316283},{"y":0.4025323907700683,"t":"entire world. From a mere two million tonnes of palm oil being produced annually globally","x":0.1440329300456733,"w":0.72633743286132812,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"y":0.42005813940204595,"c":1,"x":0.14609053644102887,"w":0.71193415323893217,"h":0.014570836043610536,"t":"50 years ago, there are now around 60 million tonnes produced every single year, a figure"},{"x":0.14197531120515047,"y":0.43604651184602117,"c":1,"h":0.015988371257085521,"w":0.53909464518229167,"t":"looking likely to double or even triple by the middle of the century."},{"t":"However, there are multiple reasons why conservationists cite the rapid spread of oil palm","x":0.14403292246914276,"y":0.46937573599793692,"c":1,"w":0.71810699462890637,"h":0.016195524146054074},{"h":0.014553715960858749,"y":0.48691860451833846,"x":0.14609053738640179,"c":1,"t":"plantations as a major concern. There are countless news stories of deforestation, habitat","w":0.70576131184895841},{"w":0.68724278767903635,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"y":0.50290697659795514,"t":"destruction and dwindling species populations, all as a direct result of land clearing to","x":0.14403292703901022},{"c":1,"t":"establish oil palm tree monoculture on an industrial scale, particularly in Malaysia and","x":0.14603914486437181,"y":0.51867487398679413,"w":0.68939442952473962,"h":0.016785156600466977},{"y":0.53621908103453264,"x":0.14403293143449891,"t":"Indonesia. Endangered species - most famously the Sumatran orangutan, but also rhinos,","w":0.71399175008138027,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"t":"elephants, tigers, and numerous other fauna - have suffered from the unstoppable spread of","h":0.015990084276322869,"c":1,"y":0.55232558124931386,"w":0.732510274251302,"x":0.14403292862024888},{"x":0.14403291988536271,"y":0.56976744171773741,"t":"oil palm plantations.","w":0.16460905710856122,"h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1},{"t":"'Palm oil is surely one of the greatest threats to global biodiversity,' declares Dr Farnon","y":0.60174418626462589,"c":1,"w":0.69753082275390621,"x":0.14197533396769699,"h":0.016041443962932833},{"c":1,"t":"Ellwood of the University of the West of England, Bristol. 'Palm oil is replacing rainforest,","x":0.14397108394803648,"y":0.61641077233385222,"w":0.72649261474609383,"h":0.018792257994167727},{"t":"and rainforest is where all the species are. That's a problem.' This has led to some radical","x":0.14601141808548637,"w":0.70592376708984383,"y":0.63291273676809467,"h":0.01821449985212098,"c":1},{"h":0.017667844522968212,"x":0.14403292143634625,"y":0.65106007060133075,"t":"questions among environmentalists, such as whether consumers should try to boycott palm","w":0.72427983601888024,"c":1},{"t":"oil entirely.","y":0.66775785954746236,"x":0.14378687411943331,"w":0.095142300923665379,"h":0.016228466348457093,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.70053003548991588,"x":0.14403291184845604,"t":"Meanwhile Bhavani Shankar, Professor at London's School of Oriental and African Studies,","w":0.7345679219563801,"h":0.017493220465202963},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"argues, 'It's easy to say that palm oil is the enemy and we should be against it. It makes for","c":1,"w":0.72633743286132824,"y":0.71790341564997651,"x":0.14403292955940694},{"h":0.016007204359074767,"w":0.71399175008138016,"y":0.73546511613286325,"c":1,"x":0.14403293145023288,"t":"a more dramatic story, and it's very intuitive. But given the complexity of the argument, I"},{"y":0.74847159602190028,"w":0.44486729939778646,"t":"think a much more nuanced story is closer to the truth?","c":1,"h":0.020917568948159437,"x":0.14386696784479089},{"x":0.8580246914705375,"w":0.024691357612609877,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"63","y":0.86773255796252025},{"x":0.67001306074217482,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.30798550923665358,"h":0.033590516718312924,"c":1,"y":0.95277082086464049}]}